+ ## Security Best Practices
+ - **Never commit** the config file to version control
+ - **Set restrictive permissions:** `chmod 600 ~/.clawhub/dingtalk-config.json`
+ - **Rotate credentials** periodically via DingTalk developer console
+ - **Use separate robots** for different environments (dev/staging/prod)